Package: crate
Title: Canonical Schemas for Changing Data and Provenance Receipts
Version: 0.14.1
Date: 2026-11-08
Authors@R: c(
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128",
                       affiliation = "New Graph Environment Ltd.")),
    person("New Graph Environment Ltd.", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
    )
Description: Declares a canonical shape for each data source it registers and
    reads or conforms data to that shape, so downstream code keeps working
    when a source renames a column, changes a type or changes its layout.
    Also holds the provenance receipt contract: a JSON Schema, RFC 8785
    canonical JSON, a table fingerprint and test vectors, with R functions
    that write receipts and compare two builds as identical, equivalent
    within a declared tolerance, or different. Under active development.
